WO-038 audit 找到 success.tsx L53 还有 aria-hidden 的 'Hermes is ready'
作为可见装饰层, 跟 L51 visible '文枢 is ready' 不一致 — 装机 user 会
同时看到中文 + 英文两遍。

按装机 user 7/24 15:10 拍板 (UI 严格用 文枢, code ID 用 wenshu):
- L53: <span aria-hidden="true">Hermes is ready</span>
    → <span aria-hidden="true">文枢 is ready</span>

不动:
- success.tsx:6/16/28 launchHermesDesktop (function name, code ID)
- styles.css L2/4/8 'Hermes Setup' (CSS developer comments, 非 user-visible)
- welcome.tsx L15 -HermesHome (CLI flag, code ID)
- store.ts L71/332 Hermes-Setup.exe (executable name, code ID)
- store.ts L350 launchHermesDesktop (function name, code ID)
- store.ts L267 'launch Hermes' (developer comment, 非 user-visible)

AC 验证:
- grep -n WERMES apps/bootstrap-installer/src → 0 hits
- grep -n 'HERMES AGENT' apps/bootstrap-installer/src → 0 hits
- grep -n 文枢 apps/bootstrap-installer/src → 14 hits (>=3)
- grep -n 'com.wenshu' apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
    → 1 hit (identifier com.wenshu.app.setup 保留)
---
 apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/success.tsx | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/success.tsx b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/success.tsx
index 02080471a..33b3a3ea7 100644
--- a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/success.tsx
+++ b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src/routes/success.tsx
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ export default function Success() {
           <span>
             <span>文枢 is ready</span>
           </span>
-          <span aria-hidden="true">Hermes is ready</span>
+          <span aria-hidden="true">文枢 is ready</span>
         </p>
 
         <p className="m-0 text-center text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-muted-foreground">
